    "detailed_description": "Welcome to The Hidden Room - Pyramid, a gripping adventure that will take you through an extraordinary journey into the world and culture of ancient Mesoamerican civilizations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready to explore the depths of the Pyramid and solve the riddles and mysteries that await you along the way. Each step will bring you closer to the truth hidden behind the ancient secrets of this monumental structure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat lies beyond the last gate? Perhaps you will find the remains of an ancient civilization with advanced technology, or perhaps you will find nothing but the silence of eternity. The only certainty is that only by playing can you find out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFace inspiring challenges, solve intricate puzzles, and immerse yourself in what were the beliefs and knowledge of those mysterious civilizations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay now and be transported on a journey that will change you forever. The Pyramid waits, ready to reveal its secrets only to those who prove themselves brave enough to face\u00a0the\u00a0unknown.",
